#import "lib/demo.typ": *
#show: demo

= Old Faithful

```{r model}
fit <- lm(eruptions ~ waiting, data = faithful)
```

An eruption lasts `{r} round(mean(faithful$eruptions), 1)` minutes.

```{r figure}
#| show: output
library(ggplot2)
p <- ggplot(faithful, aes(waiting, eruptions)) +
  geom_point(colour = "#176b87")
typst(p)
```

```{python waits}
waits = [79, 54, 74, 62, 85]
print(f"Mean wait: {sum(waits) / len(waits)} min")
```
